{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.poster.avif?t=1767735978\" width=780 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.webm?t=1767735978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.mp4?t=1767735978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>NEON-DRENCHED HORROR</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost</i>, <i>desperate</i>, <i>looking for a way out</i>. That's  when that <strong>crimson-colored envelop</strong> found it's way into your mailbox. An invitation to a game that promises a lot, enough money to solve all of your problems, a way out for those who need it... <strong>MALCADE</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>PLAY TO SURVIVE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been locked in a dingy multi-floor arcade-themed complex by someone using you for entertainment. How do you survive? By beating the arcade games scattered around the facility, managing your tokens, winning tickets, and using them to unlock the path forward. Whatever you do,\u00a0<strong>keep moving</strong>. Every second inside MALCADE counts, every encounter leaves a mark. The longer you stay, the harder it gets to exit as you were. Something\u2019s in here with you... and it doesn\u2019t want you to leave. It's been hungry for far too long.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>ESCAPE OR BE CONSUMED</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MALCADE is a short but re-playable game designed to feel like an interactive horror b-movie. Find yourself thrown into a game of death, a game filled with organic machinery, and surreal retro horror as your desperate attempt to win big turns into a nightmare.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433270?t=1767735978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/ce148e725b7bce367fae333e60096806ff125512/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767735978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/44e3cb113361015178becf830749b41f4b653ada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767735978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/44e3cb113361015178becf830749b41f4b653ada/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767735978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"MALCADE features low resolution depictions of gore, death, and general Mature Content in a retro style and may not be suitable for all ages."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.poster.avif?t=1767735978\" width=780 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.webm?t=1767735978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/extras/6a4779808943f7deef48b997f0c48ffc.mp4?t=1767735978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>NEON-DRENCHED HORROR</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost</i>, <i>desperate</i>, <i>looking for a way out</i>. That's  when that <strong>crimson-colored envelop</strong> found it's way into your mailbox. An invitation to a game that promises a lot, enough money to solve all of your problems, a way out for those who need it... <strong>MALCADE</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>PLAY TO SURVIVE</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been locked in a dingy multi-floor arcade-themed complex by someone using you for entertainment. How do you survive? By beating the arcade games scattered around the facility, managing your tokens, winning tickets, and using them to unlock the path forward. Whatever you do,\u00a0<strong>keep moving</strong>. Every second inside MALCADE counts, every encounter leaves a mark. The longer you stay, the harder it gets to exit as you were. Something\u2019s in here with you... and it doesn\u2019t want you to leave. It's been hungry for far too long.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>ESCAPE OR BE CONSUMED</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MALCADE is a short but re-playable game designed to feel like an interactive horror b-movie. Find yourself thrown into a game of death, a game filled with organic machinery, and surreal retro horror as your desperate attempt to win big turns into a nightmare.</p>","developers":["SplendidDog"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433270/ecdc47743e1eb1e59119af5e1a2e34955c11ed6d/header.jpg?t=1767735978","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"MALCADE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operat